<title>USA: Wellco president to become vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Wellco president to become vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNESVILLE, N.C. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wellco Enterprises Inc said Wednesday Rolf Kaufman, after 28 years as president, has elected to reduce his full time involvement and has been elected to the new position of vice chairman.</p>
<p>The company said Horace Auberry, after 28 years as chairman of the board, has been elected chief executive officer. He will retain the chairmanship.</p>
<p>And the company said David Lutz, after 12 years as controller, has been elected to the position of president and chief operating officer.</p>
</text>
